      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "formData": {
          "textContent": [
            {
              "type": "title",
              "value": "Late Afternoon Auto Rebate Rush"
            },
            {
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "Join us for our Late Afternoon Auto Rebate Rush, meet other hosts, and get yourself rewarded.⚡\n\n⚠️⚠️⚠️ 2025/12/16 Late Afternoon Auto Rebate Rush rewards will experience a delay and will be issued shortly(1-2days).\nParticipants may continue to join the event as usual; rewards will be distributed afterward.⚠️⚠️⚠️"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "📅 Event run dates: 12/10-12/12; 12/17-12/19; 12/24-12/26"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "⏰ Event run time: 4:00 PM - 6:00 PM PST.\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "🟣 Rewards Structure \n12/10-12/12\nlv.1 - if 10,000 beans received, get 6,000 beans reward\nlv.2 - if 20,000 beans received, get extra 5,000 beans reward\nlv.3 - if 30,000 beans received, get extra 4,000 beans reward\nlv.4 - if 40,000 beans received, get extra 6,500 beans reward\nlv.5 - if 50,000 beans received, get extra 5,000 beans reward\nThe maximum reward you can receive is 26,500 beans reward\n\n12/17-12/19\nlv.1 - if 10,000 beans received, get 6,000 beans reward\nlv.2 - if 20,000 beans received, get extra 5,000 beans reward\nlv.3 - if 30,000 beans received, get extra 4,000 beans reward\nlv.4 - if 40,000 beans received, get extra 6,500 beans reward\nlv.5 - if 50,000 beans received, get extra 5,000 beans reward\nlv.6 - if 60,000 beans received, get extra 6,000 beans reward\nlv.7 - if 70,000 beans received, get extra 5,500 beans reward\nThe maximum reward you can receive is 38,000 beans reward\n\n12/24-26\nlv.1 - if 10,000 beans received, get 6,000 beans reward\nlv.2 - if 20,000 beans received, get extra 5,000 beans reward\nlv.3 - if 30,000 beans received, get extra 4,000 beans reward\nlv.4 - if 40,000 beans received, get extra 6,500 beans reward\nlv.5 - if 50,000 beans received, get extra 5,000 beans reward\nlv.6 - if 60,000 beans received, get extra 6,000 beans reward\nlv.7 - if 70,000 beans received, get extra 5,500 beans reward\nlv.8 - if 80,000 beans received, get extra 5,500 beans reward\nThe maximum reward you can receive is 43,500 beans reward"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "underline",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "\n*Slots adding or replacements requests via Admin Chat will no longer be accepted once an event has started\"\t\nCompleting Box and Auto Reward events at the same time: rewards from auto reward events that have already been issued will be deducted from Box Event rewards.\n\n⚠️⚠️⚠️ 2025/12/16 Late Afternoon Auto Rebate Rush rewards will experience a delay and will be issued shortly(1-2days).\nParticipants may continue to join the event as usual; rewards will be distributed afterward.⚠️⚠️⚠️"
            }
          ]
        },
